      "sourceTextSha256": "b53d88c56055988f2516d1a0e61f32d7b5c98f50f74cab6559fb8d5e7573d045",
      "text": "This journey combines Guatemala’s colonial cities and Lake Atitlán with Maya archaeological sites, the mountain forests of Belize and the Caribbean Sea. Over 11 days, you will visit Antigua, Panajachel, Tikal and Yaxha, continue to Pine Ridge, explore Caracol and the caves of Cayo, then spend several days on Ambergris Caye.",
